If there is a robust-evidence-based-treatment-coverage then it is possible that the robust-evidence-based-treatment-coverage facilitates an evidence-based-default-pain-treatment and encourages the evidence-based-default-pain-treatment.
If there is a robust-evidence-based-treatment-access then it is possible that the robust-evidence-based-treatment-access facilitates an evidence-based-default-pain-treatment and encourages the evidence-based-default-pain-treatment.
If there is a pain-treatment-decision-support then it is possible that the pain-treatment-decision-support facilitates an evidence-based-default-pain-treatment and encourages the evidence-based-default-pain-treatment.
A robust-evidence-based-treatment-coverage-example includes a limited-utilization-management-example and includes a limited-cost-sharing-example.
A pain-treatment-decision-support-example is an EHR-prescribing-default-adjustment-example.
